<%- include('../partials/header', {
  pageCss: '/css/pages/services.css?v=3',
  pageTitle: 'Services | STI Assets Management Limited',
  pageDescription: 'Financial advisory, market research, portfolio and fund management, and corporate investment schemes from a SEC-regulated Nigerian asset manager.'
}) %>

<main id="main-content">

  <!-- ============================================================
       HERO
  ============================================================ -->
  <section class="page-hero" aria-labelledby="services-hero-title">
    <div class="page-hero-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <img
        src="/services-hero.webp"
        alt=""
        fetchpriority="high"
        decoding="async"
      >
    </div>

    <div class="page-hero-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="page-shell page-hero-inner">
      <div class="page-hero-copy">
        <nav class="page-breadcrumb page-enter" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span aria-current="page">Services</span>
        </nav>

        <h1
          id="services-hero-title"
          class="page-hero-title page-enter"
          style="--page-enter-delay: 120ms"
        >
          Expertise for every financial decision.
        </h1>

        <p
          class="page-hero-summary page-enter"
          style="--page-enter-delay: 240ms"
        >
          Four practices, one mandate: put research behind every position and
          keep the client informed at each step.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       01. FINANCIAL ADVISORY
  ============================================================ -->
  <section
    id="financial-advisory"
    class="page-band page-band-soft service-section"
    aria-labelledby="advisory-title"
  >
    <div class="page-shell service-layout">

      <div class="service-aside reveal-on-scroll">

        <h2 id="advisory-title" class="page-title-sm">
          Financial advisory services.
        </h2>

        <p class="page-lead">
          Advisory is where every relationship starts. Before any capital is
          deployed we agree what it is for, when you need it back, and how much
          volatility you are willing to accept along the way.
        </p>

        <p class="page-lead">
          That agreement is written down. It governs every position we
          subsequently take on your behalf.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ol class="service-capabilities reveal-on-scroll" style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
        <li class="service-capability">
          <span class="service-capability-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <i data-lucide="shield-check"></i>
          </span>
          <h3>Risk assessment</h3>
          <p>
            We establish your capacity for loss and your tolerance for it, which
            are not the same thing. The result sets the exposure limits written
            into your investment policy.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="service-capability">
          <span class="service-capability-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <i data-lucide="clipboard-list"></i>
          </span>
          <h3>Financial planning</h3>
          <p>
            A plan covering budgeting, savings and investment strategy, built
            around the commitments you actually have rather than a generic
            allocation model.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="service-capability">
          <span class="service-capability-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <i data-lucide="piggy-bank"></i>
          </span>
          <h3>Retirement planning</h3>
          <p>
            Retirement account management and income planning, structured so
            that the drawdown phase is funded without forcing you to sell into a
            weak market.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       02. MARKET RESEARCH
  ============================================================ -->
  <section
    id="market-research"
    class="page-band page-band-ink service-section"
    aria-labelledby="research-title"
  >
    <div class="page-shell service-layout">

      <div class="service-aside reveal-on-scroll">

        <h2 id="research-title" class="page-title-sm page-title-light">
          Market research.
        </h2>

        <p class="page-lead">
          Our analysts publish to clients before their work informs any position
          we take. You see the reasoning, not just the recommendation.
        </p>

        <p class="page-lead">
          Coverage spans Nigerian fixed income, equities and the macro
          conditions that move both.
        </p>

        <a href="/resources/digest" class="page-text-link page-text-link-light">
          Read the market digest
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <ol class="service-capabilities reveal-on-scroll" style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
        <li class="service-capability">
          <h3>Global market updates</h3>
          <p>
            A daily summary of domestic and global market activity, written to
            support portfolio diversification decisions rather than to fill an
            inbox.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="service-capability">
          <h3>Economic analysis</h3>
          <p>
            Regular reads on inflation, rates and currency, and what each one
            changes for the instruments you hold.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="service-capability">
          <h3>Sector analysis</h3>
          <p>
            Sector-specific research identifying where opportunity and risk are
            concentrated, updated as conditions move.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="service-capability">
          <h3>Company analysis</h3>
          <p>
            Detailed work on individual issuers, covering balance sheet
            strength and the quality of reported earnings.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       03. PORTFOLIO AND FUND MANAGEMENT
  ============================================================ -->
  <section
    id="portfolio-management"
    class="page-band page-band-light service-section"
    aria-labelledby="portfolio-title"
  >
    <div class="page-shell service-layout">

      <div class="service-aside reveal-on-scroll">

        <h2 id="portfolio-title" class="page-title-sm">
          Portfolio &amp; fund management.
        </h2>

        <p class="page-lead">
          Discretionary and advisory mandates run to a written investment
          policy, with risk limits agreed upfront and reviewed every quarter.
        </p>

        <p class="page-lead">
          Client assets are held with an independent custodian. You receive
          statements directly, on a fixed schedule.
        </p>
        <div class="service-aside-media">
          <img
            src="/pexels-markus-winkler-1430818-18512882.jpg"
            alt=""
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          >
        </div>
        <a href="/products" class="page-text-link">
          View our investment products
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <ol class="service-capabilities reveal-on-scroll" style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
        <li class="service-capability">
          <h3>Discretionary portfolio management</h3>
          <p>
            Our managers act within your written mandate without needing
            approval for each trade, which matters when a position has to be
            adjusted quickly.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="service-capability">
          <h3>Model portfolios</h3>
          <p>
            Diversified allocations matched to defined risk profiles, available
            to both individual and corporate clients.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="service-capability">
          <h3>Mutual funds</h3>
          <p>
            Access to a selected range of funds, chosen on cost, mandate clarity
            and the consistency of the manager's process.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="service-capability">
          <h3>Alternative investments</h3>
          <p>
            Diversification into real estate, private equity and hedge
            strategies, where the horizon and liquidity terms suit your mandate.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>

    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- ============================================================
       04. CORPORATE INVESTMENT SCHEMES
  ============================================================ -->
  <section
    id="corporate-schemes"
    class="page-band page-band-soft service-section"
    aria-labelledby="corporate-title"
  >
    <div class="page-shell service-layout">

      <div class="service-aside reveal-on-scroll">

        <h2 id="corporate-title" class="page-title-sm">
          Corporate investment schemes.
        </h2>

        <p class="page-lead">
          Employee savings, gratuity and treasury schemes administered end to
          end, from scheme design through to member reporting.
        </p>

        <p class="page-lead">
          The same investment discipline applies at institutional scale as it
          does to an individual mandate.
        </p>

      </div>

      <ol class="service-capabilities reveal-on-scroll" style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
        <li class="service-capability">
          <h3>Corporate cash management</h3>
          <p>
            Liquidity and cash flow managed against your working capital cycle,
            so operating funds stay available when they are needed.
          </p>
        </li>

        <li class="service-capability">
          <h3>Employee benefit plans</h3>
          <p>
            Design and administration of employee retirement schemes, including
            compliance obligations and individual member reporting.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
     CONNECTED APPROACH
============================================================ -->
<section
  class="page-band page-band-soft service-process"
  aria-labelledby="service-process-title"
>
  <div class="page-shell">

    <div class="page-section-head reveal-on-scroll">
      <p class="page-eyebrow">Our approach</p>

      <h2
        class="page-title-sm"
        id="service-process-title"
      >
        One discipline, four connected practices.
      </h2>

      <p class="page-lead">
        Each practice has a distinct role, but the strongest outcomes come
        from bringing advice, research and investment management together
        around the client's objective.
      </p>
    </div>

    <ol class="service-process-grid">

      <li class="service-process-step reveal-on-scroll">
        <span class="service-process-num">01</span>
        <h3>Advisory</h3>
        <p>
          Define objectives, liquidity requirements, risk tolerance
          and time horizon.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="service-process-step reveal-on-scroll">
        <span class="service-process-num">02</span>
        <h3>Research</h3>
        <p>
          Evaluate markets, economic conditions and opportunities
          with disciplined analysis.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="service-process-step reveal-on-scroll">
        <span class="service-process-num">03</span>
        <h3>Portfolio management</h3>
        <p>
          Translate strategy into portfolios that are constructed,
          monitored and adjusted over time.
        </p>
      </li>

      <li class="service-process-step reveal-on-scroll">
        <span class="service-process-num">04</span>
        <h3>Corporate solutions</h3>
        <p>
          Apply the same discipline to institutional liquidity,
          investments and employee benefit needs.
        </p>
      </li>

    </ol>

    <div class="service-proof-row reveal-on-scroll">
      <span>Objective-led advice</span>
      <span>Research-informed decisions</span>
      <span>Disciplined portfolio oversight</span>
      <span>Individual &amp; institutional solutions</span>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
  <!-- ============================================================
       CLOSING CTA
  ============================================================ -->
  <section class="page-band page-band-ink service-cta" aria-labelledby="services-cta-title">
    <div class="service-cta-media" aria-hidden="true">
      <img src="/services-hero.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>

    <div class="page-shell">
      <div class="page-section-head reveal-on-scroll">
        <p class="page-eyebrow page-eyebrow-light">Next step</p>

        <h2 id="services-cta-title" class="page-title-sm page-title-light">
          Start with a conversation, not a product.
        </h2>

        <p class="page-lead">
          Tell an advisor what the capital is for and the horizon you have in
          mind. We will tell you which of our services fits, or whether none of
          them do.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-cta-actions reveal-on-scroll" style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
        <a href="/contact" class="page-button page-button-invert">
          Speak with an advisor
        </a>

        <a href="/subscribe" class="page-button page-button-ghost">
          Start investing
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer', { hideFooterCta: true }) %>
